# NOTE: externalsecrets/local/boucio-local-secrets.yaml is intentionally COMMITTED
# so the local-eso-externalsecrets Flux Kustomization applies it (pik8s is not
# internet-exposed). It is therefore NOT ignored here. If you switch to SOPS,
# ignore the decrypted form instead.
# The LOCAL source of REAL third-party credentials (Datadog key, Keycloak client
# secrets, oauth2-proxy Redis password). Unlike boucio-local-secrets.yaml these
# are live credentials for services outside the cluster, and this repo is
# mirrored to a public GitHub remote, so the filled-in copy must never be
# committed. Only the .example.yaml template is tracked.
boucio-local-external-credentials.yaml

*.dec.yaml
**/.DS_Store
.DS_Store
